# =====================================================================
# Unreal Engine .gitignore
# Based on GitHub's "UnrealEngine" template, with recursive patterns so
# that plugins nesting their folders two levels deep are also covered
# (e.g. Plugins/VRExpansionPlugin/VRExpansionPlugin/Binaries).
# =====================================================================

# ---- Generated Unreal folders (never commit these) ----
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
Build/
!Build/**/*.ico
!Build/*/PakBlacklist*.txt

# ---- Lighting BuiltData ----
*_BuiltData.uasset

# ---- Visual Studio / IDE local state ----
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sln
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace
*.sln.DotSettings.user

# ---- Compiled object / binary files ----
*.o
*.obj
*.slo
*.lo
*.gch
*.pch
*.a
*.la
*.lai
*.lib
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe
*.out
*.app
*.ipa
*.exp
*.pdb
*.ipch
*.mod

# ---- Build output (guide: don't store build output in GitHub) ----
*.apk
*.pak

# ---- Precompiled source art ----
SourceArt/**/*.png
SourceArt/**/*.tga

# ---- Local scratch / backups ----
*.bak
*.tmp
*.log

# ---- Local tooling: graphify knowledge graphs (large, regenerable) ----
graphify-out/

# ---- Local tooling / editor config ----
# Not needed to build or run the project; these are personal to one machine.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.graphifyignore
.ignore
.clangd
.clang-format
.vsconfig
*.code-workspace
Plugins/InventoryBubble_Prompt.md
